//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/mb01/0090010a01'>
//《……》
《......》

//　――武者と劒冑は不離一体。

//　遠く隔てられていようとも。
//　同じ物を見、同じ声を聞くことが可能である。

//　故に、彼女も聴いた。
//　その宣告を。

//　憎悪を。
//　殺意を。
  A tsurugi and its master are one. No matter the distance between them, each can see what the other sees and hear what the other hears.

  And so Muramasa knows the ultimatum that was spoken. She felt the icy touch of hate even as her master did.

pt:
